}, {"type": "text", "x": 800, "y": 135, "text": "consume", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#0b7285"}, {"id": "db", "type": "rectangle", "x": 300, "y": 250, "width": 220, "height": 60, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 14, "text": "postgres\nissue_activities"}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 860, "y": 215, "width": -340, "height": 55, "startElementId": "wk", "endElementId": "db", "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"id": "ntf", "type": "rectangle", "x": 640, "y": 260, "width": 190, "height": 60, "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "strokeColor": "#1864ab", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "in-app Notification\n(กระดิ่งใน UI)"}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 900, "y": 215, "width": -70, "height": 60, "startElementId": "wk", "endElementId": "ntf", "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"id": "hook", "type": "rectangle", "x": 880, "y": 260, "width": 240, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "HTTP POST → receiver\nX-Plane-Event\nX-Plane-Signature (HMAC-SHA256)"}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 990, "y": 215, "width": 5, "height": 45, "startElementId": "wk", "endElementId": "hook", "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"id": "rx", "type": "rectangle", "x": 880, "y": 390, "width": 240, "height": 70, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "event-wall (FastAPI)\nตรวจลายเซ็นด้วย secret แล้วโชว์สด"}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 1000, "y": 355, "width": 0, "height": 35, "startElementId": "hook", "endElementId": "rx", "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 380, "width": 800, "height": 190, "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0}, {"type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 392, "text": "สิ่งที่ LAB 2 และ LAB 8 ให้เห็นจริง", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f"}, {"type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 425, "text": "• docker compose -p plane stop worker → สร้าง/แก้ work item หลายใบ → rabbitmqctl list_queues เห็น celery กองสูงขึ้น\n• start worker → คิวถูกดูดจนเป็น 0 ภายในไม่กี่วินาที (backpressure แบบเดียวกับ LAB RabbitMQ)\n• receiver ล่ม → worker retry 5 ครั้ง (backoff 600 s) แล้วปิด webhook ให้อัตโนมัติ · ดูได้ที่ webhook_logs", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#16212f"}]